# {{projectName}}

This repository runs on a construct materialized by `mikoshi-construct` v{{constructVersion}}:
architecture policy in [architecture/](architecture/), a harness that proves every change, and the
rules that apply to all code in [architecture/principles.md](architecture/principles.md) and
`.claude/rules/`. What follows is what is specific to this repository. Sections marked "not discovered yet" are filled by
`/construct-discover`, then kept current by whoever changes the thing they describe.

